# (as <name>_light.tga, or overrides/<basename>_light.tga with the wad dir stripped).
# With no .mat entry, MAT_Find's automatic branch probes for exactly that file and
# lights the surface. An explicit entry takes the other branch, where only the files
# it names are loaded - and this stub names no texture_emissive, so the glow is lost.
# Stub a texture only if it has no _light companion anywhere on the search path.
